<title>POLAND: BANK SLASKI OCT NET RISES TO PLN 35.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>BANK SLASKI OCT NET RISES TO PLN 35.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 35.08 vs   25.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   33.64 vs   43.60</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 40.72 vs   64.05</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     124.70 vs   99.05</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					277.94 vs  262.08</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  397.27 vs  365.68</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		670.09 vs  570.78</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues   1,146.95 vs  924.09</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Slaski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
